OL,3,GNEWSAAttacks families not told
OL,4,A'stalker' had violent past
OL,5,
OL,6,FFamilies of the Nottingham attacks
OL,7,Fvictims said police did not inform them
OL,8,Fa man who attempted to visit them had a
OL,9,Fhistory of violence.
OL,11,FValdo Calocane, who was diagnosed with
OL,12,Fparanoid schizophrenia in 2020, fatally
OL,13,Fstabbed Barnaby Webber, Grace
OL,14,FO'Malley-Kumar and Ian Coates, and
OL,15,Ftried to kill three others on 13 June
OL,16,F2023.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
