OL,3,GNEWSAAttacks families not told
OL,4,A'stalker' had violent past
OL,5,
OL,6,FDr Sanjoy Kumar, Grace's father, said
OL,7,Fthe man had visited his GP surgery in
OL,8,FLondon, while Emma Webber, Barnaby's
OL,9,Fmother, said he had also travelled to
OL,10,FSomerset, but neither were informed of
OL,11,Fthe man's history of mental ill health.
OL,13,FNottinghamshire Police said it received
OL,14,Fa complaint and due to its nature
OL,15,Freferred the matter to the Independent
OL,16,FOffice for Police Conduct (IOPC).
